From: Sandeep Somavarapu <sasomava@microsoft.com>
Subject: Filter restricted settings in nested configuration objects
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/commit/0684cb5905a3f23156f45a28135326e09310ff4d
Bug: GHSA-q2f8-hh8x-wpc2

ConfigurationModelParser only checked top-level keys against the
configuration registry. Walk nested objects and check each setting by its
effective dotted path. Remove when Code-OSS is updated to >= 1.136.2.
Index: code-editor-src/src/vs/platform/configuration/common/configurationModels.ts
===================================================================
